1
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,018
Is this your first time here?

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,686
Yeah. I'm here to see my brother.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,849
Been a while since you saw each other?

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,220
Too long.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,528
[Memory] Dante? Listen. Vicente got out of prison.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,038
[Memory] My brother? What do you mean, got out?

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,727
[Memory] He was seen in Harbor. But he's stopped answering his phone.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,407
[Memory] Wait... Who is this?

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,189
Look. They're getting ready for us to get off.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,620
Thanks for the company.

11
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,940
Good luck with your brother.
